  "paragraph": 4,
  "text": "To see why a shared standard matters so much, look at how AI integrations worked before MCP. Every AI application had to write custom glue code for every external service, while every tool company had to rebuild separate plugins for each AI platform—constantly juggling incompatible tool schemas, different authentication flows, and endless maintenance whenever an API changed.",
